  "decision": "All 12 proposed overrides rejected. Mobile-Dark is not a true dark-mode theme — text/borders/hover-states use light-theme palette values. The heuristic surfaced miscategorized bindings (e.g. dark-text-on-light-pill within a dark page tagged as text/primary role). Spec defaults from Tailwind/Material conventions are correct and have better contrast ratios (Brand/40 at 9.4:1 vs Brand/60 at 4.7:1 against Gray/95 dark surface). Task 9 visual parity check will diverge from Mobile-Dark — that's expected and correct.",
